Changelog: 20-11-2026 01:51:46

Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 01:09:32

Added. PS5 CU Tools, one window for the CU bisect and the CU unlock, came from its twin as it is there (owner, 20-11-2026: "port over as is, I do the refactor on the PS5"). Its scripts, ps5-cu-bisect.sh and ps5-cu-unlock.sh, still hold the twin's hardware: its board check, its GPU registers and masks, and its levels of 24, 32 and 40 CUs. They are not adapted to the PS5 yet and were never run on one.
